# "Until this enchantment leaves the battlefield" (CR 610.3b): if the Mystical Tether has left the battlefield before its enters
# trigger resolves, the target is not exiled at all (it would stay exiled forever otherwise). On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Tether
# for {2}{W} and picks Bot2's Mox Jet; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 destroys the Tether with Disenchant, and the
# trigger then resolves doing nothing: the Mox Jet is still on the battlefield, nothing is in exile.

